      "hanzi": "听不懂",
      "pinyin": "tīng bu dǒng",
      "meaning": "unable to understand (by listening)",
      "meaning_zh": "听了也不明白，没有这个能力",
      "theme": "t-navy",
      "examples": [
        {
          "zh": "他说得太快，我听不懂。",
          "en": "He speaks too fast, so I can't understand.",
          "audio": {
            "晓晓": "audio/tingbudong-xiaoxiao.mp3",
            "晓伊": "audio/tingbudong-xiaoyi.mp3",
            "云扬": "audio/tingbudong-yunyang.mp3",
            "云希": "audio/tingbudong-yunxi.mp3"
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": "「可能补语」的否定式：听＋不＋懂。要跟「没听懂」分清楚——「听不懂」＝没能力（听多少次都不行）；「没听懂」＝这一次没明白（可能只是没注意）。"
